{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setEmailTags:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"NSDictionary","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSDictionary"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"tags","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"forEmail:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"email"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"completion:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" (^"},{"text":")(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError","text":"NSError"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"text":"error","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":")) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"completion"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"tags","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Dictionary of tag names and values to associate with the email.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"email","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The email address to associate tags with.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Block called when the operation completes."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Receives nil on success, or an NSError on failure."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"completion"}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Same as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setEmailTags:forEmail:"},{"type":"text","text":" but provides confirmation when the operation completes."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Use this when you need to verify tags were set before proceeding with other operations."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Example","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Verify email and update tags with confirmation:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class EmailVerificationService {","","    func completeEmailVerification(email: String, verificationCode: String,","                                   completion: @escaping (Result<Void, Error>) -> Void) {","","        APIClient.shared.verifyEmail(email, code: verificationCode) { result in","            switch result {","            case .success:","                let verificationTags: [String: Any] = [","                    \"email_verified\": true,","                    \"verification_date\": ISO8601DateFormatter().string(from: Date()),","                    \"verification_method\": \"code\"","                ]","","                Pushwoosh.configure.setEmailTags(verificationTags, forEmail: email) { error in","                    if let error = error {","                        Logger.warning(\"Email tags update failed: \\(error.localizedDescription)\")","                        \/\/ Continue anyway - email is verified on backend","                    }","","                    \/\/ Also update device tags","                    Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([\"has_verified_email\": true])","","                    completion(.success(()))","                }","","            case .failure(let error):","                completion(.failure(error))","            }","        }","    }","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemailtags:foremail:completion:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","